WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.127 --> 00:00:03.770
Roxy was buried under Viktor's ugly fabric.

2
00:00:03.771 --> 00:00:07.954
"Viktor designs fabulous clothes," she thought.

3
00:00:07.955 --> 00:00:12.175
"Maybe I do need a new costume." She shook her head.

4
00:00:12.176 --> 00:00:16.170
"No!" she told herself. "Fight it!"

5
00:00:16.171 --> 00:00:18.427
Roxy remembered Terrell's words.

6
00:00:18.428 --> 00:00:21.215
"Rocket Girl doesn't need a new costume!

7
00:00:21.216 --> 00:00:24.043
The one she has is perfect!"

8
00:00:24.044 --> 00:00:30.367
"Terrell was right!" Roxy jumped out from under the fabric.

9
00:00:30.368 --> 00:00:32.977
Viktor was gone.

10
00:00:32.978 --> 00:00:36.770
"Viktor must be at the fashion show," Roxy said.

11
00:00:36.771 --> 00:00:42.022
She gulped. "My friends are there!"

12
00:00:42.023 --> 00:00:44.547
*** Roxy arrived at the

13
00:00:44.548 --> 00:00:46.644
show. People ran and

14
00:00:46.645 --> 00:00:49.020
