Suddenly the woman's eyes went blank.

22
00:01:06.457 --> 00:01:11.997
"I love this! From now on, I will only wear Viktor Velour's clothes!"

23
00:01:11.998 --> 00:01:15.119
The other mannequins threw clothes at people too.

24
00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:20.091
The clothes quickly controlled anyone they touched.

25
00:01:20.092 --> 00:01:26.789
A jacket landed on Jack's head. "I love Viktor Velour's clothes!"

26
00:01:26.790 --> 00:01:32.371
"I must stop this!" Roxy saw Viktor peeking from behind a curtain.

27
00:01:32.372 --> 00:01:35.731
She flew toward the villain.

28
00:01:35.732 --> 00:01:39.111
"Oh no!" Viktor looked around.

29
00:01:39.112 --> 00:01:44.244
"Mannequins!" he shouted. "Protect me!"

30
00:01:44.245 --> 00:01:51.441
The mannequins quickly surrounded Viktor.

31
00:01:51.442 --> 00:01:54.281
Roxy felt plastic hands grab her.

32
00:01:54.282 --> 00:01:59.898
