I don't like to fight. However . . . "

38
00:02:15.337 --> 00:02:17.520
He held an arm out toward Roxy.

39
00:02:17.521 --> 00:02:20.322
"You give me no choice!"

40
00:02:20.323 --> 00:02:25.134
Pow! Pow! Pow! Buttons shot from Viktor's sleeve.

41
00:02:25.135 --> 00:02:28.030
"Whoa!" Roxy dived out of the way.

42
00:02:28.031 --> 00:02:31.711
