43
00:02:31.712 --> 00:02:34.624
Roxy shot toward Viktor, dodging buttons.

44
00:02:34.625 --> 00:02:37.500
She slammed into him.

45
00:02:37.501 --> 00:02:39.860
"Oof!" Viktor stumbled backward. His

46
00:02:39.861 --> 00:02:41.619
hat fell off. Right

47
00:02:41.620 --> 00:02:44.483
away everyone's eyes returned to normal. A

48
00:02:44.484 --> 00:02:47.752
model screamed. "Why

49
00:02:47.753 --> 00:02:51.737
am I wearing this awful outfit?" "Where

50
00:02:51.738 --> 00:02:55.712
did I get this ugly jacket?" Jack asked. Sophie

51
