56
00:03:17.974 --> 00:03:25.606
After Roxy brought Viktor to jail, she returned to the fashion show.

57
00:03:25.607 --> 00:03:28.849
"That was amazing, Roxy!" Terrell whispered.

58
00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:31.083
